msgid ""
"Deactivating PublishPress Statuses stops registering its custom post "
"statuses. Content using those statuses may become unavailable, and parts of "
"your site may stop working until the plugin is active again."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan Status PublishPress menghentikan pendaftaran status pos "
"kustomnya. Konten yang menggunakan status tersebut mungkin menjadi tidak "
"tersedia, dan bagian dari situs Anda mungkin berhenti berfungsi sampai "
"plugin aktif kembali."

#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1259
#: resources/src/jsx/components/plugins-list/components/deactivation-warning.jsx:18
#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1140
msgid ""
"Deactivating this plugin disables its features and may affect content or "
"workflows that depend on it."
msgstr ""
"Menonaktifkan plugin ini menonaktifkan fiturnya dan dapat mempengaruhi "
"konten atau alur kerja yang bergantung padanya."

#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1268
#: resources/src/jsx/components/plugins-list/components/deactivation-warning.jsx:25
#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1147
msgid ""
"Uninstalling deletes the plugin files and may also delete its saved "
"settings or data. Its features will no longer be available. Back up your "
"site before continuing."
msgstr ""
"Menghapus instalasi menghapus file plugin dan juga dapat menghapus "
"pengaturan atau data yang tersimpan. Fitur-fitur ini tidak akan tersedia "
"lagi. Cadangkan situs Anda sebelum melanjutkan."

#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1268
#: resources/src/jsx/components/plugins-list/components/deactivation-warning.jsx:26
#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1148
msgid ""
"Without PublishPress Statuses, its custom post statuses are no longer "
"registered. Content using those statuses may become unavailable, and parts "
"of your site may stop working until the plugin is installed and active "
"again."
msgstr ""
"Tanpa Status PublishPress, status pos kustomnya tidak lagi terdaftar. "
"Konten yang menggunakan status tersebut mungkin menjadi tidak tersedia, dan "
"bagian dari situs Anda mungkin berhenti berfungsi sampai plugin diinstal "
"dan aktif kembali."

#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1268
#: resources/src/jsx/components/plugins-list/components/deactivation-warning.jsx:29
#: resources/dist/js/plugins-dashboard.js:1151
msgid ""
"Resolving this conflict can deactivate the plugin while switching versions. "
"If the version you keep cannot be activated, the plugin may remain "
"disabled. Check that it is active after resolving the conflict."
msgstr ""
"Menyelesaikan konflik ini dapat menonaktifkan plugin saat mengganti versi. "
"Jika versi yang Anda pilih tidak dapat diaktifkan, plugin mungkin tetap "
"dinonaktifkan. Periksa apakah plugin aktif setelah menyelesaikan konflik."

